{"id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-jump.md","title":"Turing Jump","display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-jump","aliases":["68-df-turing-jump"],"display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","depends_on":["[[68-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 pp.58-59 / PDF 67-68; diagonal representative via §14 p.49 / PDF 58","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 pp.58-59 / PDF 67-68; diagonal representative via §14 p.49 / PDF 58"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 的固定 oracle 程序编号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 及有限迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\">\\(A^{(n)}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A&#39;:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\varphi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A&#39;:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\varphi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^{(0)}:=A,\\qquad A^{(n+1)}:=(A^{(n)})&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^{(0)}:=A,\\qquad A^{(n+1)}:=(A^{(n)})&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书以最大的相对 RE 度定义度跳跃；此对角集合给出其具体代表。有限迭代以自然数递归确定。空 oracle 的扩充编号与普通编号只在普通程序代码上逐数一致，不能把 ∅′ 与普通停机集 K 直接认作同一集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e^A$ 的固定 oracle 程序编号见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$A'$ 及有限迭代 $A^{(n)}$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"A'","display":false},{"tex":"A^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"A':=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\varphi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A^{(0)}:=A,\\qquad A^{(n+1)}:=(A^{(n)})'.","display":true}],"bytes":1102,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]] 给出同度代表的跳跃仍同度。"},{"id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。$\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 均由下式构造。"},{"id":"e061a6cb0c6ad653","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{1\\text{-}Generic}$ 见 [[68-df-one-generic-set]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、跳跃 $G'$、$\\equiv_T$、有效并 $\\oplus$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]、[[68-df-effective-join]]。oracle 程序及其有限查询性质见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]、[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\le_T,<_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。"},{"id":"3a9f1c3bbe45ef77","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce5ab33aceacb17e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-limit-approximation]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-jump]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"]